      "flow_eyebrow_fallback": "活跃业务链",
      "flow_title_fallback": "线索 → 客户 → 跟进 → 询盘/订单 → 报价 → 复盘",
      "capture_label_fallback": "新增线索",
      "attention_label_fallback": "逾期、无下一步和待人工发送",
      "html": "<section id='dashboard' class='app-view dashboard-view sales-followup-dashboard is-active' data-view-id='dashboard' data-dashboard-signature='sales-followup-pipeline-v3'>{hero}<section class='sales-now-panel dashboard-panel' data-first-screen-slot='primary_surface' data-sales-now-panel data-composition-region='now' data-today-workboard><div data-sales-now-content></div><div class='sales-due-strip'><p data-today-summary>正在读取当前设备上的到期跟进。</p><div class='today-items' data-today-items></div></div></section><section class='sales-flow-panel dashboard-panel' data-first-screen-slot='progress' data-composition-region='flow'><div class='panel-heading'><div><span class='eyebrow'>{flow_eyebrow}</span><h2>{flow_title}</h2></div><strong data-sales-flow-summary>0 条对象</strong></div><div class='sales-home-flow' data-sales-home-flow></div></section><form class='sales-home-capture dashboard-panel' data-sales-home-capture data-composition-region='capture'><label><span>线索代号</span><input required maxlength='80' data-sales-home-alias placeholder='例如：华东-A17（不要填真实姓名）'></label><label><span>来源</span><input required maxlength='160' data-sales-home-source placeholder='展会名 / 公开入口 / 转介绍代号'></label><label><span>唯一下一步</span><input required maxlength='160' data-sales-home-action placeholder='例如：确认采购周期与规格'></label><button type='submit'>收进{capture_name}</button><p data-sales-home-feedback aria-live='polite'>只保存脱敏代号；页面不会联系客户或抓取私人联系方式。</p></form><section class='sales-attention-panel dashboard-panel' data-first-screen-slot='supporting_panel' data-composition-region='attention'><div class='panel-heading'><div><span class='eyebrow'>需要关注</span><h2>{attention_label}</h2></div>{now_link}</div><div data-sales-attention></div><details class='personal-workspace-switcher'><summary>打开完整销售工作区</summary><div class='mini-action-grid'>{workspace_links}</div></details><div class='personal-data-safety'><span>脱敏本地数据 · 消息/报价未自动发送</span><div class='today-actions'><button type='button' class='secondary' data-double6-hook='quick-export'>导出备份</button><label class='secondary today-import'><span>导入恢复</span><input class='hidden' data-double6-hook='quick-import' type='file' accept='application/json,text/plain,.json,.txt'></label></div></div></section></section>"
    }
